id: SAVE19-6
package: fandhe-workshop-core
test: history_load
target: crates/core/src/history_load.rs
find:     check_limits(LoadEntry::History, bytes).map_err(LoadReason::from)?;
replace:     let _ = check_limits(LoadEntry::History, bytes);
expect-fail: over_by_one_is_too_large
expect-fail: depth_over_is_too_deep
expect-fail: size_precedes_depth
expect-fail: depth_precedes_utf8
note: 大きさ・深さの段を外す（巨大・深い入力を解釈まで通す）
